{"id":"MOEX-112100-2301-Q060","title":"Liraglutide：注射劑型與腸泌素路徑","version":"integration-v2 after accepted tone/teaching patches","batch":"112-2-med2-q51-100","sourceSha256":"c5de8c0e3af4773e0acd1361654bb14a217102f090c6e3e4dddfcffab1615597","shortHtml":"<p><strong>選C。</strong>Liraglutide是<strong>類升糖素胜肽1（glucagon-like peptide-1，GLP-1）受體促效劑</strong>，本題所指製劑經皮下注射給藥。它是經修飾的胜肽類似物，其劑型可與表中的三種口服藥比較。</p>","html":"<h2>Liraglutide：注射劑型與腸泌素路徑</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：C</p><h3>題目問劑型：liraglutide為皮下注射劑</h3>\n<p><strong>選C。</strong>Liraglutide是<strong>類升糖素胜肽1（glucagon-like peptide-1，GLP-1）受體促效劑</strong>，本題所指製劑經皮下注射給藥。它是經修飾的胜肽類似物，其劑型可與表中的三種口服藥比較。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>藥物／給藥</th><th>核心機轉</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Acarbose／口服</td><td>抑制腸道<strong>α-glucosidase（α-葡萄糖苷酶）</strong>等醣類消化酵素，延緩醣類分解與葡萄糖吸收。</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Saxagliptin／口服</td><td>抑制<strong>二肽基胜肽酶4（dipeptidyl peptidase-4，DPP-4）</strong>，減少內生性腸泌素被去活化。</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Liraglutide／皮下注射</strong></td><td><strong>直接活化GLP-1受體</strong>，增加血糖依賴性的胰島素分泌，並降低升糖素分泌、延緩胃排空。</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rosiglitazone／口服</td><td>活化<strong>過氧化體增生劑活化受體γ（PPARγ）</strong>，調節基因轉錄、改善胰島素敏感性。</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>把「保護內生性腸泌素」與「直接活化受體」分開</h3>\n<p>Saxagliptin與liraglutide都連到腸泌素路徑，但介入位置不同：前者抑制分解酵素，後者本身就是受體促效劑。Liraglutide也較能抵抗DPP-4等酵素的代謝，有助於維持其受體促效作用。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:585px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.5625\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/60667a67cc2def127c669a7a184ed6b301b95a11300a1ab9c67e133410269231.jpg\" alt=\"GLP-1對胰島素、升糖素、胃排空與食慾的作用示意圖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"585\" height=\"1040\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/60667a67cc2def127c669a7a184ed6b301b95a11300a1ab9c67e133410269231.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>看下方兩條胰臟分泌路線：</strong>促進胰島素、抑制升糖素；正文另限定其血糖依賴性。上方胃與腦的分支連到胃排空、食慾。圖中GLP-1 RAs為GLP-1受體促效劑；器官效應由本圖定位，給藥途徑則可對照前表與正式仿單。Myluckynumber7，<em>GLP-1 Signaling in the Body</em>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 4.0</a>；原圖未裁改。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>低血糖風險與併用藥物有關。</strong>增加胰島素的藥理作用會隨血糖下降而減弱，但與胰島素或其他促分泌藥併用時，仍可能增加低血糖風險。給藥途徑則按各藥與製劑確認，本題以liraglutide皮下注射劑作辨識。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼2301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本科最後更正：Q69最終一律給分；其餘依更正答鍵</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=8fe557ae-4ff0-47a2-8ec3-37bb0fbdcc64\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed liraglutide：皮下注射、GLP-1受體及血糖依賴作用</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=1ba7a072-03b0-41f2-be7a-101145bdef3a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed acarbose：腸道醣類消化酵素</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=cbf8677c-cafe-48bc-8844-0cc6547886bd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed saxagliptin／metformin：其中saxagliptin的DPP-4機轉</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=ef14122b-7fff-45fa-b13b-0ea9e48bd57d\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed AVANDIA歷史標籤：口服rosiglitazone及PPARγ</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GLP-1_Signaling_in_the_Body.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GLP-1器官作用現成圖與CC BY 4.0授權</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：C"}